gets in the area for 2 sec. An Infernal rises from the crater, under the command of the caster for 5 min. Once control is lost, the Infernal must be Subjugated to maintain control. Can only be used outdoors.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=1122,["text"]="Summons a meteor from the Twisting Nether, causing 200 Fire damage and stunning all enemy targets in the area for 2 sec. An Infernal rises from the crater, under the command of the caster for 5 min. Once control is lost, the Infernal must be Subjugated to maintain control. Can only be used outdoors.",["level"]=50,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["1122"]={["text"]="Summons a meteor from the Twisting Nether, causing 200 Fire damage and stunning all enemy targets in the area for 2 sec. An Infernal rises from the crater, under the command of the caster for 5 min. Once control is lost, the Infernal must be Subjugated to maintain control. Can only be used outdoors.",["level"]=50,["rank"]=nil}}},["Portal of Summoning"]={["ids"]={437169},["tab"]="Demonology",["level"]=60,["status"]="new",["icon"]="inv_misc_rune_10",["passive"]=false,["cost"]="100% of base mana",["cast"]="Channeled",["cooldown"]="1 hr cooldown",["range"]="30 yd range",["description"]="Begins a ritual that creates a summoning portal. The summoning portal can be used by 2 party or raid members to summon a targeted party or raid member. The ritual portal requires the caster and 2 additional party or raid members to complete. In order to participate, all players must be out of combat and right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=437169,["text"]="Begins a ritual that creates a summoning portal. The summoning portal can be used by 2 party or raid members to summon a targeted party or raid member. The ritual portal requires the caster and 2 additional party or raid members to complete. In order to participate, all players must be out of combat and right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["level"]=60,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["437169"]={["text"]="Begins a ritual that creates a summoning portal. The summoning portal can be used by 2 party or raid members to summon a targeted party or raid member. The ritual portal requires the caster and 2 additional party or raid members to complete. In order to participate, all players must be out of combat and right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["level"]=60,["rank"]=nil}}},["Ritual of Doom"]={["ids"]={18540},["tab"]="Demonology",["level"]=60,["status"]="same",["icon"]="spell_shadow_antimagicshell",["passive"]=false,["cost"]="100% of base mana",["cast"]="Channeled",["cooldown"]="1 hr cooldown",["range"]="30 yd range",["description"]="Begins a ritual that sacrifices a random participant to summon a doomguard. The doomguard must be immediately subjugated or it will attack the ritual participants. Requires the caster and 4 additional party members to complete the ritual. In order to participate, all players must right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=18540,["text"]="Begins a ritual that sacrifices a random participant to summon a doomguard. The doomguard must be immediately subjugated or it will attack the ritual participants. Requires the caster and 4 additional party members to complete the ritual. In order to participate, all players must right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["level"]=60,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["18540"]={["text"]="Begins a ritual that sacrifices a random participant to summon a doomguard. The doomguard must be immediately subjugated or it will attack the ritual participants. Requires the caster and 4 additional party members to complete the ritual. In order to participate, all players must right-click the portal and not move until the ritual is complete.",["level"]=60,["rank"]=nil}}},["Demonic Sacrifice"]={["ids"]={18788},["tab"]="Demonology",["level"]=0,["status"]="talent",["icon"]="spell_shadow_psychicscream",["passive"]=false,["cost"]=nil,["cast"]="Instant",["cooldown"]=nil,["range"]="100 yd range",["description"]="When activated, sacrifices your summoned Demon to enhance the opposing aspect of your power, granting you an effect that lasts 2 hr. The effect is canceled if any Demon is summoned.\n\nImp: Increases your Shadow damage by 15%.\n\nVoidwalker: Restores 2% of your total Mana every 4 sec.\n\nSuccubus/Incubus: Increases your Fire damage by 15%.\n\nFelhunter: Restores 3% of your total Health every 4 sec.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=18788,["text"]="When activated, sacrifices your summoned Demon to enhance the opposing aspect of your power, granting you an effect that lasts 2 hr. The effect is canceled if any Demon is summoned.\n\nImp: Increases your Shadow damage by 15%.\n\nVoidwalker: Restores 2% of your total Mana every 4 sec.\n\nSuccubus/Incubus: Increases your Fire damage by 15%.\n\nFelhunter: Restores 3% of your total Health every 4 sec.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["18788"]={["text"]="When activated, sacrifices your summoned Demon to enhance the opposing aspect of your power, granting you an effect that lasts 2 hr. The effect is canceled if any Demon is summoned.\n\nImp: Increases your Shadow damage by 15%.\n\nVoidwalker: Restores 2% of your total Mana every 4 sec.\n\nSuccubus/Incubus: Increases your Fire damage by 15%.\n\nFelhunter: Restores 3% of your total Health every 4 sec.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}}},["Fel Domination"]={["ids"]={18708},["tab"]="Demonology",["level"]=0,["status"]="talent",["icon"]="spell_nature_removecurse",["passive"]=false,["cost"]=nil,["cast"]="Instant",["cooldown"]="5 min cooldown",["range"]=nil,["description"]="Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by 5.5 sec and its Mana cost reduced by 50%.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=18708,["text"]="Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by 5.5 sec and its Mana cost reduced by 50%.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["18708"]={["text"]="Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by 5.5 sec and its Mana cost reduced by 50%.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}}},["Soul Link"]={["ids"]={19028},["tab"]="Demonology",["level"]=0,["status"]="talent",["icon"]="spell_shadow_gathershadows",["passive"]=false,["cost"]="20% of base mana",["cast"]="Instant",["cooldown"]=nil,["range"]="100 yd range",["description"]="When active, 30% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Demon instead. In addition, both the Demon and the master will inflict 3% more damage. Lasts as long as the Demon is active.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=19028,["text"]="When active, 30% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Demon instead. In addition, both the Demon and the master will inflict 3% more damage. Lasts as long as the Demon is active.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}},["effects"]={["19028"]={["text"]="When active, 30% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Demon instead. In addition, both the Demon and the master will inflict 3% more damage. Lasts as long as the Demon is active.",["level"]=0,["rank"]=nil}}},["Immolate"]={["ids"]={348,707,1094,2941,11665,11667,11668,25309},["tab"]="Destruction",["level"]=1,["status"]="changed",["icon"]="spell_fire_immolation",["passive"]=false,["cost"]="380 Mana",["cast"]="2 sec cast",["cooldown"]=nil,["range"]="30 yd range",["description"]="Burns the enemy for 158 Fire damage and then an additional 275 Fire damage over 15 sec.",["rankEffects"]={{["id"]=348,["text"]="Burns the enemy for 11 Fire damage and then an additional 15 Fire damage over 15 sec.",["level"]=1,["rank"]=1},{["id"]=707,["text"]="Burns the enemy for 21 Fire damage and then an additional 30 Fire damage over 15 sec